      "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;\">摩根士丹利：中国AI基础模型K3，MS观点</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVF66Om4mRJsKMBmXtEiasJ4sD8DaMvsbDf1fRsM8ZheafCvE8nGnJdUF4wysQjkq2HoZHnx6dV1ajicyQ7fgcUNI8ibCldjzYXCs/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWuffz59fnt50W4mvxHDC1wSia9AYSTUd50EAxdNkmZDuLSI9oLhiawPic5JP0Ccyzo3QOWrbVDlyrr5bmrgVzpVF5dXXibTYp8Rmo/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOU8ILXejiaJnRkrDvPUqFTlAISFb6NnZhtBCDtIqiaWSkYQMAM7yjQibobGlDtIyt9OUM8AfTZYicYQ4Dt0uPWibhhWqibz6dCsQibvgg/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWV38pB5STutwcuMO4VicfgDlcFCDibAFQ1GM1cqhkdSIw6BJV5J9YIicdTg0n823IRbiaicel6YDibxZDM2b2q3ibhiaWZowHzPvyJYh8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left;\">Original report: 55-MS-China AI Foundation Model Moonshot K3 What-s Our View-260717</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600;\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
